00:11:07.123 --> 00:11:09.994
<i>Ike Foster and John Truby
died at the scene.</i>


00:11:10.726 --> 00:11:13.593
<i>The third subject, Donovan
MacDonald, remains in a coma,</i>


00:11:13.595 --> 00:11:16.133
