00:11:18.534 --> 00:11:20.668
<i>At the press conference
earlier today,</i>


00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:23.271
<i>Captain Stover of Metropolitan
Police Department</i>


00:11:23.273 --> 00:11:26.573
<i>released updated information
