of a lot of things.


00:25:37.326 --> 00:25:38.928
I'd like to know the truth.


00:25:42.965 --> 00:25:44.466
We can help you
with that.


00:25:47.468 --> 00:25:49.471
This will help you relax
before we begin.


00:25:54.376 --> 00:25:55.845
