00:26:06.988 --> 00:26:08.357
There's somebody outside.


00:26:09.425 --> 00:26:10.426
Keep him here.


00:26:30.512 --> 00:26:31.513
Get in here.


00:26:35.251 --> 00:26:35.952
Were you followed?


00:26:36.517 --> 00:26:38.120
I left behind
a few bread crumbs.


00:26:40.656 --> 00:26:41.890
Hey, Mac.


00:26:42.491 --> 00:26:43.893
